{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18471","headline":"玩月 · 欧阳詹","name":"玩月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"八月十五夕，旧嘉蟾兔光。\n斯从古人好，共下今宵堂。\n素魄皎孤凝，芳辉纷四扬。\n裴回林上头，泛灧天中央。\n皓露助流华，轻风佐浮凉。\n清冷到肌骨，洁白盈衣裳。\n惜此苦宜玩，揽之非可将。\n含情顾广庭，愿勿沈西方。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳詹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18471.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18471","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}